      "content": "i know i shouldn't be alone with it but it feels like there's nothing left to save anyway. the more i try to hold on, the faster the rooms go dark. it’s like i’m just waiting for the last light to flicker out, and honestly, it feels less like a tragedy and more like a relief. i'm just so tired of fighting the dark.",
